; RT42 / PT42 (#738). Handwritten DXF; no Tecnigrafo execution.
; Nested rectangles, flags 1,16,0; one horizontal line y=6.
; Normal: [0,2],[4,8],[10,12]; Outer: [0,2],[10,12]; Ignore: [0,12].
; 103: no external flag falls back to all loops even for Ignore.
; 104/105: SOLID uses the filtered loops too; 106 reverses loop order.
D = DXF file=input.dxf
; PT42 starts drawing the stored pattern families.
; cambia con #738
; Handle 100: 3 generated shapes.
? generated D:100 -> LINE start=0,6 end=2,6; LINE start=4,6 end=8,6; LINE start=10,6 end=12,6
; Handle 101: 2 generated shapes.
? generated D:101 -> LINE start=0,6 end=2,6; LINE start=10,6 end=12,6
; Handle 102: 1 generated shapes.
? generated D:102 -> LINE start=0,6 end=12,6
; Handle 103: 3 generated shapes.
? generated D:103 -> LINE start=0,6 end=2,6; LINE start=4,6 end=8,6; LINE start=10,6 end=12,6
; Handle 104: 1 generated shapes.
? generated D:104 -> REGION loop=polyline vertex=0,0 vertex=12,0 vertex=12,12 vertex=0,12
; Handle 105: 1 generated shapes.
? generated D:105 -> REGION loop=polyline vertex=0,0 vertex=12,0 vertex=12,12 vertex=0,12 loop=polyline vertex=2,2 vertex=10,2 vertex=10,10 vertex=2,10
; Handle 106: 2 generated shapes.
? generated D:106 -> LINE start=0,6 end=2,6; LINE start=10,6 end=12,6
